@id=declared-maturity-derived-stage @kind=decision
Feature: Maturity is declared and checked; that it works is derived

  Not one status field, which rots: how well a thing is understood is a judgement, so it is declared
  and checked against the content, and that it works is read from scenario results and never
  declared. The price is that the check sees only the shape of the content, so a placeholder
  paragraph with a token scenario is ready, and that a spec is verified only in a checkout where its
  scenarios ran.
